{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stay focused in style. Enter a sci-fi world where your productivity takes visual form.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the demo of <i>Sky Dreamer</i>, a gamified productivity app that turns your focus time into real-time progress. With a fixed Pomodoro timer and a floating city that grows as you work, staying productive becomes a visually rewarding adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s included in the demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlimited Focus Categories</strong> <br>Create as many focus categories (floating cities) as you like\u2014each with its own name, color, and theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fixed Pomodoro Timer</strong><br>The timer uses a preset work/break cycle (25/5 minutes). Timer customization is not available in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time City Growth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your chosen city expand as you focus. Buildings rise, skies shift, and spacecraft soar as a visual reflection of your effort.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Customization Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes a curated selection of:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 City styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Sky backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Spaceship designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Ambient sounds (e.g., white noise)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Active Point System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn unlimited points during sessions and spend them on unlocking visual content directly within the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing Pause Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breaks feature calm animations with drifting clouds and ambient motion to help you reset and recharge.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"hi